id=scr01_sms_receive
name=SCR01 SMS Receive
version=0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=earrmouth / Aaron
description=Minimal SMS enablement for SCR01KDU1AVK2: flips config_sms_capable through the mutable Cinnamon overlay, bootstraps the Fossify SMS role, and lets the IMS APN follow the inserted SIM. No firewall or proxy integration. Fossify Messages is fetched from its official GitHub release when absent.
